3
00:00:12,990 --> 00:00:13,030


4
00:00:19,020 --> 00:00:21,400
Inako, give it a sniff.

5
00:00:24,870 --> 00:00:27,200
It has the same smell as last year!

6
00:00:27,200 --> 00:00:30,440
Like apples,
but a little more sweet and sour.

7
00:00:30,440 --> 00:00:32,670
I love the smell!

8
00:00:32,670 --> 00:00:34,360
You surprise me.

9
00:00:34,360 --> 00:00:36,100
You'll be a good master brewer.

10
00:00:36,450 --> 00:00:38,990
Yeah. I want to become a master brewer!

11
00:00:38,990 --> 00:00:42,730
In that case,
you'd better pray to the deities.

12
00:00:43,210 --> 00:00:44,510
Deities?

13
00:00:47,070 --> 00:00:51,260
If deities don't dwell within the sake,
then it won't be any good.

14
00:00:51,260 --> 00:00:55,510
It won't make your heart glow
like the full moon.

15
00:00:55,950 --> 00:00:57,970
A faithful heart is important.

16
00:00:59,020 --> 00:01:01,500
Devote yourself to it, work hard,

17
00:01:01,800 --> 00:01:04,750
and lastly,
trust in the deities as you pray.

18
00:01:05,680 --> 00:01:08,420
That's the secret to making good sake.

19
00:01:08,930 --> 00:01:09,810
Right!

20
00:01:12,340 --> 00:01:14,970
Mother, are you okay?

21
00:01:15,640 --> 00:01:17,170
Yes, I'm fine.

22
00:01:17,170 --> 00:01:19,200
Now, let's put our hands together.

23
00:01:19,200 --> 00:01:19,870
Okay.

24
00:01:23,050 --> 00:01:26,030
What's going on? Why are you in the dark?

25
00:01:26,030 --> 00:01:30,090
I was wondering where
Mother's sake brewing records were.

26
00:01:30,970 --> 00:01:33,760
Oh, yes. Where did we put them?

27
00:01:34,500 --> 00:01:36,240
It's not this either.

28
00:01:39,230 --> 00:01:43,160
Inako, do you want to become
a master brewer?

29
00:01:45,340 --> 00:01:46,380
Yes.

30
00:01:50,460 --> 00:01:52,050
I'm sure you can.

31
00:01:53,420 --> 00:01:54,150
Yes!

32
00:01:54,680 --> 00:01:55,890
What are you doing?

33
00:01:56,540 --> 00:01:58,470
I was looking for Mother's notes—

34
00:01:59,060 --> 00:02:00,930
What good will that do?

35
00:02:01,790 --> 00:02:05,600
Your marriage into the Mizoe family
has already been arranged!

36
00:02:05,600 --> 00:02:06,700
Father!

37
00:02:10,800 --> 00:02:12,240
For heaven's sake.

38
00:02:18,350 --> 00:02:19,760
Naeko.

39
00:02:20,240 --> 00:02:23,000
If only you were here…

40
00:02:23,000 --> 00:02:23,040


